    "created_at": "2026-10-01T00:04:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-01T00:04:45Z",
    "body": "> This means conformance checkers no longer need to work out what selectors match or might match.\r\n\r\nYes. For my implementation, of the roughly 2500 lines of code needed to implement this as previously specified here, about 2000 lines of that were for the selector matching. So as currently specified in this PR, the requirements here are going to be on the order of 80% simpler for conformance-checker developers to implement and maintain.\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
