    "body": "After discussing with colleagues I think (3) is the right balance.\r\n\r\nThere are other ways to cause layout shifts (e.g. `<template for>`, `<img>` without specified dimensions, `@font-face`), which are not disallowed. By requiring `@scope` we can check for the obvious FOUC footgun without restricting features.",
